## SwiftFlow 0.3.1

- Project: https://github.com/aaurelions/SwiftFlow
- Tag: v0.3.1
- Commit: 98ff46633257d188f1819255df8c8453a9b72d8f
- License: MIT (root LICENSE.md). Copyright (c) 2026 A.Aurelions
- How it is used: Swift Package Manager, exact version 0.3.1, product
  SwiftFlow, linked by Floretta-macOS, Floretta-iOS, and FlorettaTests.
- What we use: Viewport, SwiftFlowInstance screen/flow conversion and zoomTo,
  getViewportForBounds, getIntersectingNodes.
- What we changed: nothing inside the package. Floretta keeps its own
  LayoutEngine, canvas drawing, keyboard model, and a 1.25 cap when fitting
  content. Pointer zoom calls SwiftFlowInstance.zoomTo after placing the
  pointer at the view center, because that method anchors the view center.

