## Mindscape — not a dependency

Mindscape 0.7.0 (https://github.com/jiuxianzai/Mindscape, commit
258dfe9eac45aba4607afd09309ada88554988b5, MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 jiuxianzai)
was read for IME behavior. No Mindscape source file is in this repository and
the Xcode project does not link it.

Floretta's text view observes marked-text changes for the same reason theirs
does: NSTextView does not send textDidChange while composing. EditingTextView
and the iOS text view are written here. They publish the composing string into
our document so the node can widen, and they leave the system candidate window
on the text view's caret. Their editor, camera, layout, and SQLite store were
not copied.
